This is to certify that *DR. DEBANUJ CHATTERJEE* (BS-MS, IISER Kolkata, batch 2012–2017), presently a Marie Skłodowska-Curie Postdoctoral Researcher at the University of Lille, France, has been a member of the editorial team of #link("https://scicomm.iiserkol.ac.in/about/")[_Inscight_], the popular science magazine of the *Indian Institute of Science Education and Research Kolkata*, since January 2025.

During this period, he has contributed to the editing of nine issues of the magazine, by reviewing and refining articles for scientific accuracy and readability. His continued involvement with the magazine and with IISER Kolkata, alongside his postdoctoral research commitments, reflects a genuine and sustained commitment to science communication and public engagement with research. His efforts have also helped strengthen the alumni–student–faculty bond and the broader alumni network.

The Institute places on record its appreciation of his contribution to this initiative and extends its best wishes for his future endeavours.

